Rload vout 0 {rload}

* --- feedback divider + type-III error amp (as r3, inline op-amp) ---
Ra vout fbnode {ra}
Rb fbnode 0 {rb}

Vrefsrc vrefnode 0 DC {vref}
Goa opout 0 vrefnode compin {gm_oa}
Roa opout 0 {ro_oa}
Coa opout 0 {co_oa}

R1in fbnode compin {r1}
R3in fbnode n3 {r3}
C3in n3 compin {c3}
C1f compin opout {c1}
R2f compin n2 {r2}
C2f n2 opout {c2}

* --- synthetic PEX net: tree topology, 11111 nodes, coupled onto vout ---
Rtreecouple vout tree_0 10
